examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.accept: "auth.accept" holding a name with a * prefix is refused by --target nginx: nginx sets a request header only by a name its configuration writes; write each name in full
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt: "auth.jwt" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.audiences: "auth.jwt.audiences" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.ca: "auth.jwt.ca" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.claims: "auth.jwt.claims" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.claims.x-roles: "auth.jwt.claims.<header name>" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.claims.x-subject: "auth.jwt.claims.<header name>" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.header: "auth.jwt.header" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.issuer: "auth.jwt.issuer" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.keys: "auth.jwt.keys" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: auth.jwt.optional: "auth.jwt.optional" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source cannot verify a token (nginx Plus's auth_jwt); verify it in the service, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: limits.connections: "limits.connections" is refused by --target nginx: nginx counts its own listening sockets and every connection to a service against one limit, and closes a client's idle connection to take a new one, so no nginx setting holds client connections to a number; remove limits.connections, or render it for envoy
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: remove_from_clients: "remove_from_clients" holding a name with a * prefix is refused by --target nginx: nginx takes each header by name; write each name in full
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: services.shop.health: "services.<service name>.health" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source has no active health checks (nginx Plus's health_check); remove health, and nginx keeps every backend in the pool
examples/full/hocon/Proxyfile: services.shop.health.grpc: "services.<service name>.health.grpc" is refused by --target nginx: nginx open source has no active health checks (nginx Plus's health_check); remove health, and nginx keeps every backend in the pool
